{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/steam-page-1.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pro Jank Footy</strong> is an absurd and over-the-top arcade sports game.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score a goal? Your opponent picks a game-changing power-up.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hinder your opponents, increase your footy abilities with powers that give your team strong legs, or turn the gameplay completely on its head by transforming everyone into footballs \u2013 the choice is yours!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outplay, out-kick, and out-jank your mates in local multiplayer. Or, if you\u2019re shy,  conquer single player season mode.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PieThin.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AUSTRALIAN RULES FOOTBALL LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN IT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Australian Footy is the most attended domestic sports league in the world! 36 players on a field, an obscenely large oval, and a ball that looks like a sunburnt lemon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For those outside the loop, \u201cAussie Rules\u201d could mean anything. </strong>Pro Jank Footy takes this confusion and runs with it\u2014a fast-paced, comedic sports game where you're always changing the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PieThin_Flipped.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORLD CLASS COMEDY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With commentating from <strong>Aunty Donna's Broden Kelly</strong> and the creative minds of\u00a0<strong>David Ashby</strong> and<strong> Dario Russo</strong> behind cult TV series <strong>Danger 5</strong> and <strong>Italian Spiderman</strong> driving the humor, Pro Jank Footy is jam-packed with comedy, charm and Australianisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Versus.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1v1 &amp; 2v2 MODES</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or challenge your mates in couch co-op and online play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_1.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ROGUELITE GAMEPLAY</strong> \u2013 Every goal scored lets your opponent choose from over <strong>200+ ridiculous power-ups</strong> that completely alter the match. Or, play classic mode for simple, arcade footy with no power-ups.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_2.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEASON MODE</strong> \u2013 Lead your team through a <strong>full premiership season</strong> with deck-building mechanics to unlock and customize power-ups as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_3.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RETRO ARCADE NOSTALGIA</strong> \u2013 Inspired by  classic 90s sports games, blending pixel-perfect action with buttery-smooth modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_4.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUELY AUSTRALIAN</strong> \u2013 Aussie Rules meets Aussie humor. <strong>It\u2019s chaotic, unpredictable, and proudly embraces Australian culture.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_5.png?t=1744188107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>MULTIPLE TEAMS &amp; STADIUMS</strong> \u2013 Play as <strong>12 unique teams</strong> across <strong>8 iconic stadiums</strong>, each with their own quirks, hazards, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Header.png?t=1744188107\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1744188107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1744188107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744188107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744188107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller